# format-device.sh provenance

Source: Valve jupiter-hw-support /usr/lib/hwsupport/format-device.sh, hand-ported.

Ours:
  - mmcblk only (sda is the internal UFS disk)
  - owner 1000:1000 kept, so a card stays writable on a SteamOS device
  - pocknix-steamos-shim's steamos-format-device fronts it

Last synced: never (hand-ported).
